// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Superboard — Full Schema
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
// Includes all models required by the application.
// Tables with @@map() already exist in the database.
// New tables will be created via prisma db push.
// ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

datasource db {
  provider  = "postgresql"
  url       = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

// ── User (Tutor / Agency Owner accounts) ──

model User {
  id                    String    @id @default(uuid())
  email                 String    @unique
  name                  String?
  tier                  String    @default("FREE") // FREE | PRO | AGENCY | AGENCY_STANDARD | AGENCY_PREMIUM
  isAdmin               Boolean   @default(false)
  status                String    @default("ACTIVE") // ACTIVE | SUSPENDED | BANNED
  stripeCustomerId      String?   @unique
  stripeSubscriptionId  String?
  fingerprintHash       String?
  customDomain          String?   @unique
  parentEmail           String?
  under13               Boolean   @default(false)
  dataDeletedAt         DateTime?
  gracePeriodEndsAt     DateTime?
  // Referral system
  referralCode          String?   @unique
  referralCount         Int       @default(0)
  referralRewardClaimed Boolean   @default(false)
  referredByCode        String?
  // Agency fields
  parentAgencyId        String?
  brandingLogoUrl       String?
  brandingColor         String?
  agencyName            String?
  // Widget system
  installedWidgets      Json?
  // Tutor preferences (feature toggles, defaults, etc.)
  // Shape: { startLessonFromProfile?: bool, startLessonFromLibrary?: bool, ... }
  // Missing key = feature default (true for feature flags). Adding new
  // preferences requires no migration — just read with a default here.
  preferences           Json?
  createdAt             DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt             DateTime  @updatedAt

  // Relations
  rooms              Room[]
  templates          Template[]
  usageLogs          UsageLog[]
  sentInvites        AgencyInvite[]
  agencyMembers      AgencyMember[]       @relation("AgencyOwner")
  agencyMemberships  AgencyMember[]       @relation("AgencyTutor")
  bookings           Booking[]
  scheduleSlots      ScheduleSlot[]
  auditLogs          AuditLog[]
  students           Student[]            @relation("AgencyOwnerStudent")
  creditPacks        CreditPack[]
  homeworkAssigned   Homework[]           @relation("HomeworkTutor")
  homeworkAssignments HomeworkAssignment[] @relation("HwAssignmentTutor")
  resourceAgencies     ResourceLibrary[] @relation("ResourceAgency")
  resourceUploads      ResourceLibrary[] @relation("ResourceUploader")
  lessonNotes        LessonNote[]
  invoicesCreated    Invoice[]            @relation("InvoiceCreator")
  subscriptions      Subscription[]
  exportJobs         ExportJob[]

  @@index([parentAgencyId])
}

// ── Agency Member (sub-tutor relationship) ──

model AgencyMember {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId    String
  tutorId     String
  joinedAt    DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation("AgencyOwner", fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  tutor  User @relation("AgencyTutor", fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([agencyId, tutorId])
  @@index([tutorId])
}

// ── Agency Invite ──

model AgencyInvite {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId     String
  code         String   @unique
  invitedEmail String?
  recipientId  String?  @unique
  status       String   @default("PENDING")
  expiresAt    DateTime
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation(fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([status])
  @@index([code])
}

// ── Room ──

model Room {
  id              String    @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId         String
  subject         String    @default("GENERAL")
  isActive        Boolean   @default(true)
  startedAt       DateTime?
  endedAt         DateTime?
  durationMinutes Int       @default(0)
  brandingLogo    String?
  brandingColor   String?
  createdAt       DateTime  @default(now())

  // Library fields (F-01 Board Library)
  title           String?   // tutor-named board title
  studentName     String?   // who this board is for
  isArchived      Boolean   @default(false)
  lastOpenedAt    DateTime?
  tags            String[]  @default([])

  // Relations
  tutor        User              @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  pages        BoardPage[]
  chatMessages ChatMessage[]
  participants  RoomParticipant[]
  recordings   Recording[]
  lessonNotes  LessonNote[]
  boardVersions BoardVersion[]

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([isActive])
  @@index([isArchived])
}

// ── Board Page ──

model BoardPage {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId    String
  pageIndex Int
  snapshot  Json
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @db.Timestamp(6)

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([roomId, pageIndex])
  @@index([roomId])
}

// ── Template ──

model Template {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String
  name        String   @db.VarChar(100)
  description String?  @db.VarChar(500)
  subject     String   @default("GENERAL")
  gradeBand   String   @default("") @map("grade_band")
  tags        String[] @default([])
  isPublic    Boolean  @default(false) @map("is_public")
  snapshot    Json
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  tutor User @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([isPublic])
  @@index([subject])
  @@index([gradeBand])
}

// ── Chat Message ──

model ChatMessage {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId      String
  senderId    String?
  senderLabel String
  content     String   @db.Text
  fileUrl     String?
  fileName    String?
  isPinned    Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @db.Timestamp(6)

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId, createdAt])
}

// ── Usage Log ──

model UsageLog {
  id                    String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId                String
  periodStartDate       DateTime @db.Date
  videoMinutesUsed      Int      @default(0)
  aiCreditsUsed         Int      @default(0)
  estimatedAiSpendCents Int      @default(0)

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([userId, periodStartDate])
  @@index([userId])
}

// ── Room Participant (tracks who is/was in a room) ──
// Maps to existing DB table with additional columns added.

model RoomParticipant {
  id              String    @id @default(uuid()) @map("id")
  roomId          String    @map("room_id")
  userId          String?   @map("user_id")
  role            String    @default("participant") @map("role")
  joinedAt        DateTime  @default(now()) @map("joined_at")
  leftAt          DateTime? @map("left_at")
  isOnline        Boolean   @default(false) @map("is_online")
  studentIdentity String?   @map("studentIdentity")
  studentName     String?   @map("studentName")
  studentId       String?   @map("studentId")
  lastActiveAt    DateTime? @map("lastActiveAt")

  room Room? @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([roomId, studentIdentity])
  @@index([roomId])
  @@index([userId])

  @@map("RoomParticipant")
}

// ── Booking (lesson bookings) ──
// Maps to existing DB table.

model Booking {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId      String
  studentName  String
  studentEmail String?
  parentId     String?
  slotId       String
  bookingDate  DateTime @db.Date
  startTime    String
  endTime      String
  status       String   @default("upcoming") // upcoming | completed | cancelled
  roomId       String?
  notes        String?   @db.Text
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  tutor User @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([status])

  @@map("Booking")
}

// ── Schedule Slot ──
// Maps to existing DB table.

model ScheduleSlot {
  id        String  @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId   String
  dayOfWeek Int
  startTime String
  endTime   String
  timezone  String  @default("UTC")
  isActive  Boolean @default(true)

  tutor User @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])

  @@map("ScheduleSlot")
}

// ── Student (Agency student roster) ──

model Student {
  id                String    @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId          String
  email             String
  name              String?
  isActive          Boolean   @default(true)
  parentAccessToken  String?   @unique
  deactivatedAt     DateTime?
  createdAt         DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt         DateTime  @updatedAt

  // ── F-05 Student Profile fields ──
  // Parent / guardian contact (separate from student email)
  parentName        String?
  parentEmail       String?
  parentPhone       String?

  // Consent flags — tutor records what they have permission for
  consentPhoto      Boolean   @default(false)
  consentVideo      Boolean   @default(false)
  consentRecording  Boolean   @default(false)
  consentMarketing  Boolean   @default(false)
  consentAt         DateTime?  // when consent was last recorded

  // Academic context
  gradeLevel        String?    // free-form: "Grade 5", "Year 6", "K"
  subjects          String[]   @default([])
  notes             String?    @db.Text  // free-form tutor notes about the student

  // Per-student join link — token is opaque, revocable, and tied to isActive
  joinToken         String?    @unique
  joinTokenGeneratedAt DateTime?

  agency User @relation("AgencyOwnerStudent", fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  homeworkAssignments HomeworkAssignment[] @relation("HwAssignmentStudent")

  @@unique([agencyId, email])
  @@index([agencyId])
  @@index([email])
  @@index([joinToken])
}

// ── Audit Log (admin action trail) ──

model AuditLog {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId    String?
  user      User?    @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  action    String
  target    String?
  details   Json?    @db.JsonB
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([userId])
  @@index([action])
  @@index([createdAt])
}

// ── Recording (room session recordings) ──

model Recording {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  roomId       String
  tutorId      String
  startedAt    DateTime?
  endedAt      DateTime?
  durationSec  Int       @default(0)
  status       String    @default("recording") // recording | processing | ready | failed | deleted
  storageUrl   String?
  thumbnailUrl String?
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())

  room Room @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId])
  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([status])
}

// ── Subscription (Stripe subscription tracking) ──

model Subscription {
  id                  String    @id @default(uuid())
  userId              String    @unique
  stripeSubscriptionId String?   @unique
  stripePriceId       String?
  status              String    @default("active") // active | past_due | canceled | trialing
  currentPeriodStart  DateTime?
  currentPeriodEnd    DateTime?
  cancelAtPeriodEnd   Boolean   @default(false)
  createdAt           DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt           DateTime  @updatedAt

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
}

// ── Platform Config (global settings) ──

model PlatformConfig {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  key       String   @unique
  value     Json?    @db.JsonB
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime  @updatedAt
}

// ── Invoice ──

model Invoice {
  id              String   @id @default(uuid())
  creatorId       String
  studentName     String
  amount          Float
  currency        String   @default("usd")
  status          String   @default("draft") // draft | sent | paid | overdue | canceled
  dueDate         DateTime?
  paidAt          DateTime?
  items           Json?    @db.JsonB
  notes           String?  @db.Text
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt

  creator User @relation("InvoiceCreator", fields: [creatorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([creatorId])
  @@index([status])
}

// ── Scheduled Lesson ──

model ScheduledLesson {
  id          String    @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String
  studentName String?
  studentEmail String?
  subject     String    @default("GENERAL")
  startTime   DateTime
  endTime     DateTime?
  status      String    @default("scheduled") // scheduled | completed | cancelled
  roomId      String?
  notes       String?   @db.Text
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([status])
}

// ── Credit Pack (agency credit system) ──

model CreditPack {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId  String
  credits   Int
  price     Float
  status    String   @default("active")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  agency User @relation(fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([agencyId])
}

// ── Homework ──

model Homework {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String
  roomId      String?
  title       String
  description String?  @db.Text
  dueDate     DateTime?
  status      String   @default("assigned") // assigned | submitted | graded
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  tutor User @relation("HomeworkTutor", fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([roomId])
}

// ── Lesson Note ──
// Maps to existing session_notes table.

model LessonNote {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  roomId    String
  tutorId   String?
  tutor     User?    @relation(fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  content   String   @default("") @db.Text
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  room Room? @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId])

  @@map("session_notes")
}

// ── Webhook Config ──

model WebhookConfig {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  userId    String
  url       String
  events    String[]
  secret    String?
  isActive  Boolean  @default(true)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([userId])
}

// ── Question Item (question bank) ──

model QuestionItem {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId     String?
  type        String   @default("multiple_choice") // multiple_choice | short_answer | true_false
  subject     String   @default("GENERAL")
  difficulty  String   @default("medium")
  question    String   @db.Text
  options     Json?    @db.JsonB
  correctAnswer String? @db.Text
  explanation String?  @db.Text
  tags        String[]
 createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([subject])
}

// ── Homework Assignment (F-04 v1.3 — standalone board snapshot) ──

model HomeworkAssignment {
  id              String   @id @default(uuid())
  tutorId         String
  studentId       String?
  sourceRoomId    String?

  // Identity & access
  assignmentToken String   @unique

  // Content (three separate snapshots — never merged)
  sourceSnapshot  Json     // the board as assigned (immutable)
  studentSnapshot Json     // student's work (updated by autosave)
  feedbackSnapshot Json?   // tutor's annotations (separate layer)

  // Metadata
  title           String
  description     String?  @db.Text

  // Status machine: assigned → in_progress → submitted → returned → reviewed
  status          String   @default("assigned")
  openedAt        DateTime?  // F-05+ — when student first opened the link (null until first open)
  submittedAt     DateTime?
  late            Boolean  @default(false)

  // Two-date model
  dueAt           DateTime?
  submitUntil     DateTime  // dueAt + 7d, or createdAt + 30d
  viewUntil       DateTime  // submitUntil + 90d

  // Parent communication
  parentNotifyOnReview Boolean @default(false)

  createdAt       DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime @updatedAt

  tutor           User      @relation("HwAssignmentTutor", fields: [tutorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  student         Student?  @relation("HwAssignmentStudent", fields: [studentId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  notifications   HomeworkNotification[]

  @@index([tutorId])
  @@index([studentId])
  @@index([status])
  @@index([assignmentToken])
}

// ── Homework Notification Log (idempotency for email notifications) ──
// Tracks which notifications have been sent for which assignment, so
// we never double-send (e.g. if a status transition fires twice or
// the cron reprocesses a job).
model HomeworkNotification {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  assignmentId String
  event        String   // assigned, opened, submitted, returned, reviewed
  channel      String   @default("email") // future: sms, push, etc.
  recipient    String   // email address the notification was sent to
  sentAt       DateTime @default(now())

  assignment HomeworkAssignment @relation(fields: [assignmentId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([assignmentId, event, channel, recipient])
  @@index([assignmentId])
}

// ── Export Job (F-07 Full Data Export) ──
// Async background job for bulk data export. Tutor clicks "Export
// everything" → row inserted with status 'pending' → Vercel Cron
// picks it up, processes, marks 'completed' or 'failed', emails
// the tutor a signed download URL.
model ExportJob {
  id           String    @id @default(uuid())
  userId       String
  status       String    @default("pending")  // pending | processing | completed | failed
  format       String    @default("zip+pdf")  // future-proofing
  boardCount   Int       @default(0)          // how many boards were included
  fileSizeBytes Int      @default(0)
  downloadUrl  String?   // signed URL or storage path
  storagePath  String?   // internal: where we stored the file
  error        String?   @db.Text
  requestedAt  DateTime  @default(now())
  startedAt    DateTime?
  completedAt  DateTime?

  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([userId])
  @@index([status])
  @@index([requestedAt])
}

// ── Email Suppression List (F-08 email hardening) ──
// Tracks email addresses that should NEVER receive email from us:
//   • Bounced (hard bounce — address doesn't exist)
//   • Complaint (recipient marked as spam)
//   • Unsubscribed (parent/student opted out via /unsubscribe/[token])
//
// Checked before every sendEmail() call. This protects deliverability
// (sending to known-bad addresses tanks your sender reputation) and
// ensures legal compliance (CAN-SPAM/GDPR require honoring unsubscribes).
model EmailSuppression {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid())
  email        String   // always stored lowercase (normalized in code)
  reason       String   // bounce | complaint | unsubscribe
  // For bounces/complaints: the Resend event ID. For unsubscribes:
  // a token derived from the email (so we can look up by token without
  // exposing the raw email in the URL).
  source       String?  // resend | manual | unsubscribe-link
  eventDetails Json?    @db.JsonB  // raw Resend webhook payload for debugging
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([email, reason])
  @@index([email])
  @@index([reason])
}

// ── Resource Library (agency-scoped resources) ──

model ResourceLibrary {
  id            String   @id @default(uuid())
  agencyId      String
  uploadedBy    String
  name          String
  description   String?  @db.Text
  category      String   @default("general")
  subject       String   @default("GENERAL")
  fileUrl       String
  fileType      String   @default("file")
  fileSize      Int      @default(0)
  downloadCount Int      @default(0)
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime @updatedAt

  agency     User      @relation("ResourceAgency", fields: [agencyId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  uploader   User      @relation("ResourceUploader", fields: [uploadedBy], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([agencyId])
  @@index([subject])
  @@index([category])
}

// ── Language exercise data (lang routes) ──

model LanguageExercise {
  id            String   @id @default(uuid()) @map("id")
  widgetKind    String   @map("widget_kind")
  difficulty    String   @default("beginner") @map("difficulty")
  band          String   @default("K-5") @map("band")
  discriminator String?  @map("discriminator")
  question      String   @db.Text @map("question")
  options       Json?    @map("options")
  answer        String?  @map("answer")
  explanation   String?  @db.Text @map("explanation")
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@index([widgetKind])
  @@index([difficulty])
  @@index([band])
  @@map("language_exercises")
}

model StudentMastery {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid()) @map("id")
  userId       String   @map("user_id")
  roomId       String?  @map("room_id")
  widgetKind   String   @map("widget_kind")
  questionId   String?  @map("question_id")
  correct      Boolean  @map("correct")
  answeredAt   DateTime @default(now()) @map("answered_at")

  @@index([userId])
  @@index([roomId])
  @@index([widgetKind])
  @@map("student_mastery")
}

model VocabCard {
  id           String   @id @default(uuid()) @map("id")
  pos          String   @default("noun") @map("pos")
  level        String   @default("K-5") @map("level")
  word         String   @map("word")
  definition   String   @db.Text @map("definition")
  example      String?  @db.Text @map("example")
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@index([pos])
  @@index([level])
  @@map("vocab_cards")
}

// ── Board Version History (F-01 — capped at 10 per board) ──

model BoardVersion {
  id         String   @id @default(uuid())
  boardId    String   // = Room.id
  snapshot   Json     // full board state at this point in time
  versionNum Int      // 1, 2, 3... (10 max, oldest deleted when 11th is created)
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())

  board      Room     @relation(fields: [boardId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([boardId, versionNum])
  @@index([boardId])
}
